; ===== START G-CODE FOR ENDER 3 (PLA, 0.6mm Nozzle, 0.3mm Layer, OrcaSlicer, 10mm/s max) =====
G90 ; Absolute positioning
M83 ; Extruder RELATIVE mode
; --- Pre-Heat Sequence & Homing ---
M117 Heating Bed & Nozzle...
M140 S65 ; Bed temp from OrcaSlicer variable
M104 S215 ; Nozzle temp from OrcaSlicer variable
M117 Homing Axes...
G28 ; Home all axes
G1 Z2.0 F300 ; Lift Z slightly (10mm/s)
M117 Waiting for Temps...
M190 S65 ; Wait for bed
M109 S215 ; Wait for nozzle
; --- Purge / Prime Line (Folded Z-Pattern) ---
M117 Purge Line...
G92 E0 ; Reset extruder
G1 X10 Y0.5 Z0.3 F600 ; Move to first layer height and start position
G1 E3.0 F300 ; Slow extrude 3mm to get filament flowing
; Segment 1: Forward 25mm
G1 X35.0 E6.0 F600 ; Extrude 6mm over 25mm
; Wipe move: shift Y
G1 Y1.5 F600 ; Shift Y slightly to avoid dragging nozzle
; Segment 2: Backward 25mm
G1 X10.0 E6.0 F600 ; Extrude another 6mm back
; --- Post-Purge Retraction & Z-Hop (anti-string) ---
G1 E-2.5 F1800 ; Retract 2.5mm at 30mm/s to seal nozzle
G1 Z2.0 F300 ; Z-hop to travel clearance height
; --- Wipe nozzle tip across purge line ---
G1 X15.0 Y1.5 F600 ; Wipe across purge bead to shear any remaining string
G92 E0 ; Reset extruder
M117 Printing...
